# Gity — public frontend configuration (safe to commit; no secrets here).
# There is deliberately NO GitHub token in this file.
#
# Hosting is Cloudflare Pages (static export in out/) + Pages Functions
# (functions/api/*) for the login exchange. No build-time secrets needed:
# GITHUB_CLIENT_ID is public and set in the Cloudflare dashboard, and
# GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET is stored as an encrypted Pages secret.

# Link to this repo, shown in the footer/sidebar ("Star on GitHub").
NEXT_PUBLIC_REPO_URL=https://github.com/Patel230/gity
